---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fave & Tea Wedding Gallery: Kennedy Ekanem"
  description="A shared wedding gallery where guests sign in, upload their photos, and relive the day moment by moment."
>
  <article class="project-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work</a>

    <header class="project-header">
      <p class="project-meta">Web development · Events · Photo sharing</p>
      <h1>Fave &amp; Tea Wedding Gallery</h1>
      <p class="project-intro">
        A shared wedding gallery where guests sign in, upload their photos from the
        day, and browse everyone's memories organized moment by moment.
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="project-image">
      <a href="https://favextea.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="/images/favextea.jpg" alt="Fave &amp; Tea wedding gallery welcome screen with guest sign-in form" />
      </a>
      <figcaption>The guest welcome screen. <a href="https://favextea.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the live site ↗</a></figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="project-copy">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Wedding photos usually end up scattered across dozens of guests' phones. This
        gallery gives the couple and their guests one place to collect them: every guest
        can upload what they captured, and everyone can see the whole day come together.
      </p>
      <p>
        Uploads go straight to a Google Drive folder through a Google Apps Script backend,
        so the couple keeps the original files without needing a separate storage service.
      </p>

      <h2>Key features</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Lightweight guest sessions:</strong> guests join with a name and email, and returning guests can restore their session with just their email.</li>
        <li><strong>Moment-by-moment albums:</strong> photos are grouped into the day's moments, from getting ready and guests' arrival to the couple's grand entrance, speeches and toasts, and the dance floor.</li>
        <li><strong>Multi-photo uploads:</strong> guests choose one or more images from a phone or laptop, pick a category, and add them to the gallery.</li>
        <li><strong>Ownership controls:</strong> guests can delete their own uploads, but not anyone else's.</li>
        <li><strong>Order of events:</strong> the church ceremony and reception programmes are available in the app.</li>
        <li><strong>Downloads:</strong> guests can save any photo from the shared gallery.</li>
      </ul>

      <dl class="details">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Web development</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Built for</dt><dd>Fave &amp; Tea</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Year</dt><dd>2026</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Technology</dt><dd>React, Vite, Framer Motion, Google Apps Script, Google Drive</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Live site</dt><dd><a href="https://favextea.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">favextea.onrender.com</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <nav class="project-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
      <a href="/#work">All projects</a>
      <a href="/projects/sortapp">Next: SortApp →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-page{width:min(100% - 40px,680px);margin:0 auto;padding:64px 0 100px}.project-header{margin-top:72px;padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.project-meta{margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.project-header h1{margin:0;font:clamp(34px,5vw,46px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em}.project-intro{max-width:620px;margin:24px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.project-image{width:100%;margin:38px 0 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--img-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--img-bg)}.project-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px}.project-image figcaption{margin:12px 0 -12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.project-copy{margin-top:58px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.project-copy h2{margin:48px 0 10px;font:26px/1.3 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}.project-copy h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.project-copy p{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted)}.project-copy ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}.project-copy li{margin:0 0 16px}.project-copy strong{color:var(--text)}.project-copy code{font-size:.82em}.details{margin:50px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.details div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.details dt{color:var(--muted);font:10px Mono;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.details dd{margin:0;font-size:13px}.project-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:68px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.project-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:600px){.project-page{padding-top:38px}.project-header{margin-top:48px}.project-header h1{font-size:32px}.project-intro{font-size:15px}.project-image{padding:12px}.project-image figcaption{margin-bottom:-4px}.project-copy{margin-top:44px;font-size:16px}.details div{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}}
</style>
